      "mergeID": "6a6248543cbd99a4cd22efa2",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I'm seeing some cases of online users reporting as offline, preventing me from requesting on them. This user in the screen shot for example just left my instance, and was previously shown as online, but now no longer is. I've double-checked too and they are still actually online as of this post.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Online User Reporting as Offline",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "6a61729d60c3376708311580",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm not sure this is open beta related. API bugs out from time to time like this and did last night. I was in an instance with some friends last night prior to the beta push. Two were \"black/offline\" status and one was green.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
